# Claude Code state — session/project caches stay local, but committed
# agent and skill definitions under .claude/agents/ and .claude/skills/
# are shared with the team. Use .claude/* (not .claude/) so the directory
# itself isn't ignored — otherwise the !.claude/agents/** negation cannot
# re-include children.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
# cloudless-design is installed per-machine from the design-system kit
# (see Cloudless Design System (1)/HANDOFF.md). Personal scope - re-ignore.
.claude/skills/cloudless-design/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/settings.json

